# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if used in a multi-platform environment:
#   Pipfile.lock under certain conditions could cause lock mismatch.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock is generally recommended to be checked in.
